<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Dec 19.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Dec 19.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Advance Bank Australia Ltd A$6.18 (+.12)</p>
<p>*St George Bank Ltd A$7.68 (+.05)</p>
<p>The Australia Financial Review reports that the Australian Securities Commission may move to block the Advance-St George proposed merger after receiving legal advice that raise concerns about the structure of the deal.</p>
<p>The Sydney Morning Herald also reports Advance Bank is worried that National Australia Bank Ltd is building a stake in the bank in an attempt to scuttle the merger proposal with St George. Advance shareholders vote on the merger plan on Monday.</p>
<p>*WMC Ltd A$7.53 (+.06)</p>
<p>WMC said on Thursday before market open it plans to proceed with the A$650 million development of its Duchess phosphate deposit near Mount Isa in Queensland.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
